    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n504" root="اذن" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأْذُونٌ</span></b> , as meaning A slave <i>permitted,</i> or
<i>having leave given him, by his master, to traffic,</i>
is used for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَأْذُونٌ لَهُ</span>, (Msb, TA,) by the lawyers.
(Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>Having his ear hit,</i> or <i>hurt;</i>
and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤْذَنٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

